From: Harley Acheson <harley.acheson@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Nov 2025 18:35:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] UI: Quad View Resizing

This PR allows resizing of the Quad View quadrants by dragging from the
center point. This creates a new action zone type of AZONE_REGION_QUAD
for this purpose. Snapping to 12ths by holding down Ctrl.

Pull Request: https://projects.blender.org/blender/blender/pulls/148801
