Subject: [PATCH 2/3] UI: Fine adjusting values with arrows on number button

When editing number buttons with arrow keys, allow precision editing
similar to drag editing of button. This supports step_size increment
with shift, ctrl and ctrl+shift key.
There's little issue when incrementing few float properties of Rotation
type. `step_size` is 100 for them which increments value by large factor
during ctrl click.

See PR description for videos

Pull Request: https://projects.blender.org/blender/blender/pulls/161290
